{"kind":"FETCH","data":{"headers":{},"body":"{\"id\":40546,\"title\":\"The 10th Kingdom\",\"tagline\":\"\",\"overview\":\"Virginia and Tony, a father and daughter living in Manhattan, find themselves in a parallel universe where Snow White, Cinderella and Little Red Riding Hood are struggling to maintain order. Their kingdoms have been fragmented by trolls, giants and goblins.\",\"posterPath\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/aD5ISjx3AG1rygncAdv7eb8KYYo.jpg\",\"backdropPath\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/hIImI4RaqgrcJSOwJbnUFEE8SbL.jpg\",\"youtubeBackdrop\":null,\"anilistBanner\":null,\"rating\":7.6,\"voteCount\":283,\"year\":2000,\"genres\":[\"Sci-Fi & Fantasy\",\"Comedy\",\"Family\",\"Mystery\"],\"status\":\"Ended\",\"type\":\"tv\",\"totalSeasons\":1,\"totalEpisodes\":5,\"createdBy\":[\"Simon Moore\"],\"networks\":[\"NBC\"],\"countries\":[{\"code\":\"US\",\"name\":\"United States of America\"}],\"lastAirDate\":\"2000-03-06\",\"cast\":[{\"id\":79925,\"name\":\"Herbert Wise\",\"character\":\"Director\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/i33dO3Zcl3yC1UDWtVAFTLdY6oq.jpg\"},{\"id\":2380,\"name\":\"David Carson\",\"character\":\"Director\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/gGcwEmUu7eFgQKUmIQaf8IpUIU3.jpg\"},{\"id\":70696,\"name\":\"Kimberly Williams-Paisley\",\"character\":\"Virginia Lewis\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/eTI5HvnVZoaFgdwERtboGJfREhD.jpg\"},{\"id\":14101,\"name\":\"John Larroquette\",\"character\":\"Anthony Lewis\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/rWXMelYm34YIBOzJJaQrBI50NEp.jpg\"},{\"id\":83721,\"name\":\"Scott Cohen\",\"character\":\"Wolf\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/xzm9EQQ4R62V2z2I2UagOuYGa9Y.jpg\"},{\"id\":1902,\"name\":\"Dianne Wiest\",\"character\":\"Evil Queen\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/p9mfzY68FtEbedOMNB5X4eBShhx.jpg\"},{\"id\":3072,\"name\":\"Daniel Lapaine\",\"character\":\"Prince Wendell\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/5usnxFLjVgrJjY9T3Pvpy51Foh.jpg\"},{\"id\":585,\"name\":\"Rutger Hauer\",\"character\":\"Huntsman\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/xyag0LbjocTwx2Ht7B3RofvCNMT.jpg\"},{\"id\":18977,\"name\":\"Ed O'Neill\",\"character\":\"Relish the Troll King\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/4RrxSno3UEtGWuMm4yJoaFzckpL.jpg\"},{\"id\":87819,\"name\":\"Dawnn Lewis\",\"character\":\"Blabberwort the Troll\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/ppxGgmkTczev2VsiOSMfaGUy580.jpg\"},{\"id\":123392,\"name\":\"Hugh O'Gorman\",\"character\":\"Burly the Troll\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/1A9ucmcxLrcW6vo6SzhZWjs2IYo.jpg\"},{\"id\":116526,\"name\":\"Jeremiah Birkett\",\"character\":\"Blue Bell the Troll\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/8iFr7rPmJ2YpjFANVCpL9T3UvcK.jpg\"},{\"id\":23076,\"name\":\"Robert Hardy\",\"character\":\"Chancellor Griswold\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/5FK7rDWRsbNwAMsHHpkpeGafFtu.jpg\"},{\"id\":123394,\"name\":\"William Osborne\",\"character\":\"Lord Rupert\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/u5qAMzK0camlc6NNxH7407HKhmA.jpg\"},{\"id\":138415,\"name\":\"Edward Jewesbury\",\"character\":\"Old Retainer\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/52VarIRkuFrbuRhDoum8A0WD1dg.jpg\"},{\"id\":13567,\"name\":\"Ann-Margret\",\"character\":\"Cinderella\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/z20lA2EyYbLcZn5GV1deMQDUCEc.jpg\"},{\"id\":11184,\"name\":\"Warwick Davis\",\"character\":\"Acorn\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/vUwjgAYcBEcCv0OVAN00qUUXX3V.jpg\"}],\"trailers\":[{\"key\":\"BvUKXV8lb8c\",\"name\":\"Official Trailer\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"},{\"key\":\"gbrXWWYopq8\",\"name\":\"Official Trailer\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"},{\"key\":\"OI59gNweXOo\",\"name\":\"Official Trailer\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"}],\"similar\":[{\"id\":128554,\"title\":\"Power Rangers Dino Force Brave\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/7fVOuYEdogkUJagxJJkOsupXE1G.jpg\",\"rating\":7.5,\"year\":2017,\"type\":\"tv\",\"_score\":0.3053571428571429,\"_genreOverlap\":3},{\"id\":281016,\"title\":\"Boyfriend on Demand\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/1WSuH8eK44KDavNggmWhKS5zUCF.jpg\",\"rating\":8.4,\"year\":2026,\"type\":\"tv\",\"_score\":0.2057692307692308,\"_genreOverlap\":2},{\"id\":128182,\"title\":\"Post Scriptum - An Optimistic Look at the End of the World\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/u3aN08K5fVWRkNrIqN1gqUoKVc9.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"year\":2021,\"type\":\"tv\",\"_score\":0.20566037735849058,\"_genreOverlap\":2}],\"seasonNumber\":1,\"seasonName\":\"Miniseries\",\"seasonOverview\":\"\",\"seasonPoster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/aD5ISjx3AG1rygncAdv7eb8KYYo.jpg\",\"seasonAirDate\":\"2000-02-27\",\"episodes\":[{\"number\":1,\"name\":\"Part 1\",\"overview\":\"Thanks to Relish the Troll King, the Evil Queen is once again free, and she has a trap ready for Prince Wendell. Her dog transforms into Prince Wendell and Prince Wendell becomes a dog. While trying to escape, the real Prince Wendell accidentally turns on a magic mirror, and runs away into 10th kingdom. Virginia hits him with her bicycle, feeling bad about hitting a dog; she takes him to work with her. Wolf and Relish the Troll Kings kids are after the real Prince, and they are looking all over New York for him.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/wb2e4P8WtT2186a9e5YhJa33lQr.jpg\",\"rating\":8,\"voteCount\":3,\"airDate\":\"2000-02-27\",\"runtime\":120},{\"number\":2,\"name\":\"Part 2\",\"overview\":\"Tony is imprisoned in Snow White Memorial Prison, and Virginia breaks him out with the help of a half-wolf who has fallen in love with her. Tony and Virginia are torn between trying to find their way home and helping Prince Wendell defeat the Evil Queen. Trolls working for the Queen chase them throughout the nine kingdoms, and they soon realize that the land of fairy tales is not what it used to be; the age of \\\"happily ever after\\\" is long gone.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/gb5KnGKkhqijkz8MwWyupGDt4vl.jpg\",\"rating\":8,\"voteCount\":3,\"airDate\":\"2000-02-28\",\"runtime\":120},{\"number\":3,\"name\":\"Part 3\",\"overview\":\"Prince Wendell's aides are beginning to suspect that something is amiss with the prince's absence, just weeks from his coronation. The Huntsman has captured Virginia under orders from the Evil Queen, and Tony and the Wolf save her. They find a village with the magic mirror that will take them home, but Wolf is captured and put on trial for attacking local sheep.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/vfxZ8YxTFIRdT7dQ9b6xdKTOLha.jpg\",\"rating\":8.3,\"voteCount\":3,\"airDate\":\"2000-03-01\",\"runtime\":120},{\"number\":4,\"name\":\"Part 4\",\"overview\":\"Prince Wendell's coronation is cancelled due to his absence, as unbeknownst to his kingdom, he is still trapped as a dog and traveling with Virginia and Tony Lewis. To their horror, the imposter Prince Wendell arrives to be crowned king and the forces of the Evil Queen chase the true Wendell deep into the wilderness. Even worse, the magic mirror needed to return to New York has shattered.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/obbUhy6x72dYfNZCx11r9VmCRRA.jpg\",\"rating\":7.5,\"voteCount\":2,\"airDate\":\"2000-03-05\",\"runtime\":120},{\"number\":5,\"name\":\"Part 5\",\"overview\":\"The imposter Prince Wendell, a puppet of the Evil Queen, is about to be crowned king. The ghost of Snow White reveals to Virginia that she is destined to save the nine kingdoms. They sneak into the ball and make plans to expose the fake prince as an imposter and turn the real Wendell back into a human. The fate of the kingdoms are in the balance.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/kXY1BdCF0SmVY9fJFy1MAU5hTRF.jpg\",\"rating\":7.5,\"voteCount\":2,\"airDate\":\"2000-03-06\",\"runtime\":120}],\"firstAirDate\":\"2000-02-27\"}","status":200,"url":""},"revalidate":86400,"tags":[]}